  "limitations": [
    "Nadir footprint, GSD and overlap use a fixed reference plane and ideal pinhole optics. Actual attitude, altitude, entry, turns, controller error and 2 Hz wall-clock acquisition can differ.",
    "The real test estimated 13 route photos and acquired 16 including entry and actual flight-path deviation. The first photo was at 0.912 m height while climbing; it is not a 10 m planned survey image.",
    "The preview footprint is at the first planned waypoint, not an already acquired image; map extent remains limited to ±500 m.",
    "Applying stages ordinary waypoint drafts and sets a gimbal target plus distance capture controls. It starts neither flight nor acquisition; mission completion does not automatically stop capture.",
    "Datasets retain the existing 30 frame / 24 MiB limits. Plans are not persisted or exported as survey plans; route JSON contains ordinary waypoints only.",
    "No terrain-adaptive overlap, obstacle avoidance, mosaicking, orthophotos, calibrated real-camera model, new native SITL or hardware testing."
  ],
